window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>If he claims her, all will be lost. If he doesn't, he loses himself.</p> <p>Myk is the rogue alien warrior's brooding weapons master. Fresh from his hell-like forge, he's the definition of an alien angel of death. He thinks he knows what will heal him.</p> <p>He wants a child.</p> <p>And he's chosen me to fulfil this desire.</p> <p>I can't deny that there's something about Myk that calls to my bruised heart. An alien bad boy who needs my help. But do I want to give him my body, when all I want to do is feed his soul?</p> <p>Can I enter into this arrangement without risking everything . . . again?</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
